<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#S4.SS3" title="In IV Evaluation &amp; Results ‣ Towards Trustworthy Agentic IoEV: AI Agents for Explainable Cyberthreat Mitigation and State Analytics" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref"><span class="ltx_text">IV-C</span> </span><span class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Safety and Security</span></span></a>
<ol class="ltx_toclist ltx_toclist_subsection">
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsubsection"><a href="#S4.SS3.SSS1" title="In IV-C Safety and Security ‣ IV Evaluation &amp; Results ‣ Towards Trustworthy Agentic IoEV: AI Agents for Explainable Cyberthreat Mitigation and State Analytics" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref"><span class="ltx_text">IV-C</span>1 </span>ML/DL Models Performance</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsubsection"><a href="#S4.SS3.SSS2" title="In IV-C Safety and Security ‣ IV Evaluation &amp; Results ‣ Towards Trustworthy Agentic IoEV: AI Agents for Explainable Cyberthreat Mitigation and State Analytics" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref"><span class="ltx_text">IV-C</span>2 </span>Explainability and Human-Centered Interpretation</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsubsection"><a href="#S4.SS3.SSS3" title="In IV-C Safety and Security ‣ IV Evaluation &amp; Results ‣ Towards Trustworthy Agentic IoEV: AI Agents for Explainable Cyberthreat Mitigation and State Analytics" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref"><span class="ltx_text">IV-C</span>3 </span>SSAs Explainability Performance</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
