</ol></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_section"><a href="#S5" title="In Towards Trustworthy Agentic IoEV: AI Agents for Explainable Cyberthreat Mitigation and State Analytics" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">V </span><span class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">Conclusion and Future Work</span></span></a></li>
